      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/sql_injection",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "012.php 登录查询 SQL 注入（CWE-89）\n\n攻击者通过 HTTP GET 参数 `username`（012.php:5 读取）提交任意字符串，该值被直接拼进 012.php:14 的 SQL 语句 `SELECT * FROM `users` WHERE user = '$user' AND password = '$pass';`，随后在 012.php:15 交给 mysqli_query 执行。代码中仅对 `$pass` 调用了 mysqli_real_escape_string（012.php:10），`$user` 没有任何转义、类型约束或参数化处理，因此单引号可闭合字符串字面量，注入任意 SQL 片段（例如 `username=' OR '1'='1' -- ` 绕过认证，或使用 UNION/布尔/时间盲注读取 users 表）。查询失败时 012.php:15 的 die() 还会把 mysqli_error 原文回显到页面，构成报错型注入的信息泄露通道。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "012.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 13,
                  "endLine": 15
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "sunsetFindingId": "GEN-3b547dba7a60"
          },
          "properties": {
            "finding_id": "GEN-3b547dba7a60",
            "confidence": 0.83,
            "verdict": "candidate",
            "evidence_level": "rule_verified+llm",
            "cwe": "CWE-89",
            "endpoint": "/012",
            "http_method": "ANY",
            "has_poc": true,
            "origin": "rule"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/brute_force",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "012.php 登录接口缺少暴力破解防护（CWE-307）\n\n012.php:3 通过 `if( isset( $_GET[ 'Login' ] ) )` 进入登录处理，随后在 012.php:14-15 校验用户名与口令。整个流程中未见失败次数计数、账号/IP 锁定、验证码、指数退避或速率限制等任何反暴力破解机制，且登录凭据通过 GET 参数传递（`username`、`password`），便于脚本化批量重放。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "012.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 2,
                  "endLine": 3
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "sunsetFindingId": "SEM-536ee862bb25"
          },
          "properties": {
            "finding_id": "SEM-536ee862bb25",
            "confidence": 0.6,
            "verdict": "candidate",
            "evidence_level": "rule_verified+llm",
            "cwe": "CWE-307",
            "endpoint": "/012",
            "http_method": "ANY",
            "has_poc": true,
            "origin": "rule"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/weak_crypto",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "012.php 使用 MD5 存储口令（CWE-328）\n\n012.php:11 执行 `$pass = md5( $pass );`，将用户口令以无盐 MD5 单轮哈希形式处理，随后在 012.php:14 的查询中与数据库中的口令值比较。MD5 属已被证明存在实用碰撞且计算速度极快的哈希算法，用于口令存储时无法抵抗离线暴力破解与彩虹表攻击；代码中未见盐值（salt）或迭代（如 bcrypt/Argon2/PBKDF2）等加固措施。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "012.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 10,
                  "endLine": 11
                }
              }
            }
          ],
